  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "根据我的观察，目前在各个行业工作的年轻人，以及许多在校大学生和中学生，普遍对文艺充满热爱。",
      "output_sha256": "2f67cdad86e8a0add2ea3e53bbd8d343672d115e15c53f5bfb485346c469d396",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": 0.480752,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "96d9232b0b2a2d3956c8502001e2c4405af53cff0353e1fafc380f807e8e8d65"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2f67cdad86e8a0add2ea3e53bbd8d343672d115e15c53f5bfb485346c469d396",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "很多人在业余时间努力写作，希望未来能成为作家。",
      "output_sha256": "cac9ad1a363770c75030487cf5d8eddfedb31ed597f1c6cc032142bd85fb49b8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.531591,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3a5657008f0fabcbc1b0b1b3ac6bb1266b713563846b7f916cbec3a31ef2db98"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cac9ad1a363770c75030487cf5d8eddfedb31ed597f1c6cc032142bd85fb49b8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这是个好现象。",
      "output_sha256": "8c357d62b3b627efd7b37dbcfce1a06741f734407f1892fd171a2cbf954e4fda",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "8c357d62b3b627efd7b37dbcfce1a06741f734407f1892fd171a2cbf954e4fda",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "今天，我们的农业合作化事业和私营工商界的社会主义改造事业都真是风起云涌，得到了惊人的发展。",
      "output_sha256": "3fe96c37a0a84172e54b841b2b985532325ae81086037d15534d41e8834cfc8d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "3fe96c37a0a84172e54b841b2b985532325ae81086037d15534d41e8834cfc8d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "看到这个事实，咱们谁能不高兴得要跳起来欢呼呢？",
      "output_sha256": "4d93c162d5b974d2493661c1bf119eb75cdd8c02e4f8f7a055a794f3f6b4a94a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "4d93c162d5b974d2493661c1bf119eb75cdd8c02e4f8f7a055a794f3f6b4a94a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是，一想到文艺工作怎么能够配合这突飞猛进的社会主义建设，咱们就难免有点耽心了。",
      "output_sha256": "a8e94854fca59b44dcae67d3ae7141aa7b4f9ca9634e49d0a09ae61fa92d9320",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "a8e94854fca59b44dcae67d3ae7141aa7b4f9ca9634e49d0a09ae61fa92d9320",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "首先是：咱们的作家太少，不够用的啊！",
      "output_sha256": "ce44156feb51c9e1ce6049c3798c985535d04cea6ccb0b7a5405a2efee2095cc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_human_sha256": "ce44156feb51c9e1ce6049c3798c985535d04cea6ccb0b7a5405a2efee2095cc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "中国作家协会的会员仅有五百多位，这显然不够。",
      "output_sha256": "051c4c5106e101d29637116fbf994e4806874a7f46e5ee59ed9258353ede71a2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.54685,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "2c60c41b47b370a8a96b859207b49b921989e5e66385c680d86dc2c341aef986"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "051c4c5106e101d29637116fbf994e4806874a7f46e5ee59ed9258353ede71a2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "那么，培养新生力量必定是刻不容缓的事。",
      "output_sha256": "712860a9da45556785644f7d5cb752b1181fbb2a27bdce19f59727ab8ac4a15b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "712860a9da45556785644f7d5cb752b1181fbb2a27bdce19f59727ab8ac4a15b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "新生力量必定主要地来自青年，这也无须多加解释。",
      "output_sha256": "84ab8e8a81937df7157a1bacaabcd1065b85d8e07a3d8d1eecebc055da49028b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "84ab8e8a81937df7157a1bacaabcd1065b85d8e07a3d8d1eecebc055da49028b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "今天在业余课余进行写作的青年当中，我相信，必有一部分将来会成为作家。",
      "output_sha256": "29d09cca96f63dbfd8d947375c5005e3dd54c95b67016eb11c0ab08cbc4e9008",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "29d09cca96f63dbfd8d947375c5005e3dd54c95b67016eb11c0ab08cbc4e9008",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他们就是文艺队伍的后备力量。",
      "output_sha256": "c35353d30545ae2597052049449a705220ee93a313baf9b4776b578216b345db",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "c35353d30545ae2597052049449a705220ee93a313baf9b4776b578216b345db",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "青年业余的文艺爱好者，努力不懈地往下干吧，文艺界殷切地期待着你们来壮大队伍啊！",
      "output_sha256": "57a641a8e98a89d88554bfdc78d9da10dbcb40b09e163293d36ce4b4314763ea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "57a641a8e98a89d88554bfdc78d9da10dbcb40b09e163293d36ce4b4314763ea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而，我必须坦诚，成为作家并非易事。",
      "output_sha256": "e7f007e7b270cca5b056ffa983ae1770199968933277a8aaf8c5b6c9281b2443",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": 0.441,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a1dc53644de68d9bf9ca0d40126b4711146ac8fcd3dbe2f52437b1fe19fc2969"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e7f007e7b270cca5b056ffa983ae1770199968933277a8aaf8c5b6c9281b2443",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "首先，作家需要掌握语言文字这一工具。",
      "output_sha256": "a215a4753fb53b49bbb0654c7c9c0972dc4ab0f97083ee39f9f1c12192fc34f6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.512778,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "92fd35169e211a87f3b13afd4258cf11662d3221a046cbd0ed4924acad10c827"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a215a4753fb53b49bbb0654c7c9c0972dc4ab0f97083ee39f9f1c12192fc34f6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "如果文字表达不流畅，就无法顺利进行写作，正如一个木匠若无法熟练使用锯、刨等工具，就无法制作出一张桌子。",
      "output_sha256": "53e28e64c31b926a5bbf65b26ded02aea444da5ae57884d31c0ea1136a7305b0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.584165,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b12795fee9498df53c20241b83b5c4231b74d8703eb073faaffd42bae78a9bef"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "53e28e64c31b926a5bbf65b26ded02aea444da5ae57884d31c0ea1136a7305b0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "因此，一个爱好文艺的青年，必须要求自己把文字写通顺。",
      "output_sha256": "f204c2b443ca0536327cf806e6b0db1b8572114e45faf9d46e91bdea5e346b5a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "f204c2b443ca0536327cf806e6b0db1b8572114e45faf9d46e91bdea5e346b5a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "文字写得流畅，对未来从事任何职业都有帮助，无论是工程师还是演员，都需要用清晰的语言传播知识、分享经验。",
      "output_sha256": "9baa0d1b03cd29d08d4ec311851cbb02bc59f996f241f6c3773a477960bdf88b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": 0.387215,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fe6ba584d751502d0486a5182e8ea188c9b05d6ca04583efd28a854378c583f8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9baa0d1b03cd29d08d4ec311851cbb02bc59f996f241f6c3773a477960bdf88b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "努力学习语言文字绝对是有益的，若想成为作家，更是需要扎实的语言基础。",
      "output_sha256": "1dd143ecf2891a7e4823bf43fc8e2c7a54335b50bff1c6884bbfae958e84eecf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.437205,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        19,
        20
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f964c1413c79f5b22237d7113b89f8662d6c346472eed1321dda46674e603307",
        "74293870afeea5b01a7e2067be0e586ab083aa9237b62979c81cd31bc7eedbfe"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1dd143ecf2891a7e4823bf43fc8e2c7a54335b50bff1c6884bbfae958e84eecf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "有的青年性子太急，还没能够写一笔通顺文字，便想写剧本或小说了，而且希望马上拿去发表。",
      "output_sha256": "a2d779c985f4e153e56b9e4b7d9513ef03c91bea33b8e63b67a782df9bc97116",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "a2d779c985f4e153e56b9e4b7d9513ef03c91bea33b8e63b67a782df9bc97116",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "练习写剧本与小说也未为不可（顶好还是先练习写短文），但须看明白这是为练习文字，积累经验，不一定能够成为作品。",
      "output_sha256": "979e109f15abf2b1c29bbbbb0bccbe0490d80f9ee5eef41fd8cb67e3fdf609fa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "979e109f15abf2b1c29bbbbb0bccbe0490d80f9ee5eef41fd8cb67e3fdf609fa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我在童年时期，就学对对子，作旧诗；但是我那时候作旧诗的目的只是为练习文字，不能说我写成的五言八句或七言八句就算作诗。",
      "output_sha256": "48b8bcce8f1a53a104e76f64f2df1d4dbbf40ad0e46a61d4d6c00a89397bdf1a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "48b8bcce8f1a53a104e76f64f2df1d4dbbf40ad0e46a61d4d6c00a89397bdf1a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "要是那么说，我岂不早就成为诗人了么？",
      "output_sha256": "48b8fe3f0cd7608cfcc24a6989ffbb5bf0dd885b82f22c8bf927c6120827ea0e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "48b8fe3f0cd7608cfcc24a6989ffbb5bf0dd885b82f22c8bf927c6120827ea0e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是，我到现在还没成为诗人！",
      "output_sha256": "1b2c6cbdb3a9a26f33f435a817f8851d1e6abf0a4484faf7e58b79dfd0bdfd45",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "1b2c6cbdb3a9a26f33f435a817f8851d1e6abf0a4484faf7e58b79dfd0bdfd45",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "文学作品并不能一挥而就，一学就会。",
      "output_sha256": "7a70e0d3680ee3688c9a298c85786f142013070e1580762527398418963f3a4f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "7a70e0d3680ee3688c9a298c85786f142013070e1580762527398418963f3a4f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "用小说或剧本的形式写作，并不意味着就能写出真正的作品，若连文字都未能流畅表达，就更无从谈起。",
      "output_sha256": "9d5d755a1222b351eb285877d6eac749b9b5d0a7eb7d5c58269a878276ba61a5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.371428,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9a6e9e715b9c5df02635fe04a059e44469725723b106dac9c5520dea3e58a892"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9d5d755a1222b351eb285877d6eac749b9b5d0a7eb7d5c58269a878276ba61a5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "文学作品既是用文字写成的，我们就必须首先注意文字，而不应不管文字通不通，就算作作品。",
      "output_sha256": "19a3b874732f40b340f1990f51b74637c7dd78b0c627a63b31bfe0e27b53f506",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "19a3b874732f40b340f1990f51b74637c7dd78b0c627a63b31bfe0e27b53f506",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "练习文字须下很大的功夫。",
      "output_sha256": "d8ed5a7a5515fe782f630c698306ecf2e084d97051ab4bac5b84c1e108d687ca",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "d8ed5a7a5515fe782f630c698306ecf2e084d97051ab4bac5b84c1e108d687ca",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们不应心急。",
      "output_sha256": "08979117f3d14ee9f2031d258aa89213aaeba62cbf7c2bf68f1a787d9aeeb8cf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "08979117f3d14ee9f2031d258aa89213aaeba62cbf7c2bf68f1a787d9aeeb8cf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "急于成名而不肯苦学，终究是无益的。",
      "output_sha256": "73a0d044b0420afe772b3431f73d7279cd7bede1836b88329896ce37996b42dc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": 0.485,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3affd6a303157d66897c2b80fe2753fe18c127b07e63aca24cd1fcef7c94d9fc"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "73a0d044b0420afe772b3431f73d7279cd7bede1836b88329896ce37996b42dc",
