      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "要完成一部作品，除了语言文字外，还需要更多的要素。",
      "output_sha256": "646c96c98129137839e3cf8ab59093bc811d00cce04771cc018191ddec87d6ff",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.581952,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fa44c6abd338cbda5356a6e6da9c80ad7e16ba5d6ffba4a77d3b0945e6d263ea"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_ai_sha256": "646c96c98129137839e3cf8ab59093bc811d00cce04771cc018191ddec87d6ff",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        27
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "以我自身为例，近年来我写了不少作品，但写得如何呢？",
      "output_sha256": "003c526362429ab962e750d0b63bc1fd49a2f00c29e4f334d9ea3e9c20c7b58d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": 0.514638,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "191663fe142ad3bda38304d0f4b8cac36673b4401af26a44a984a05df496751e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "003c526362429ab962e750d0b63bc1fd49a2f00c29e4f334d9ea3e9c20c7b58d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是，写的好不好呢？",
      "output_sha256": "9452ce71e8591bdb2198767d1176a90862ee254d846dad3a842019072a55016a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "9452ce71e8591bdb2198767d1176a90862ee254d846dad3a842019072a55016a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "可以肯定地说，质量并不算高！",
      "output_sha256": "b9c70258769d90012b39bc00f428d97ebc65b368ca8bb1fee6e42aabc569de88",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.459868,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        35,
        36
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0fe3b0791c1e8693806f58ed482b2b07c36e976b24b60b99202f75ee739578a0",
        "bd815207ac76c5b5977fdcc4c624624cc289a54f7f6eee979edeb4b7be7c08c3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b9c70258769d90012b39bc00f428d97ebc65b368ca8bb1fee6e42aabc569de88",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "是我的文字不通顺吗？",
      "output_sha256": "bfce0e50e62233906ee763afde61bea63702863f7ef04cc43cb44e15fd0109a2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "bfce0e50e62233906ee763afde61bea63702863f7ef04cc43cb44e15fd0109a2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不是。",
      "output_sha256": "ff6ea90a4338e4ee979fc7afa57197b839aff587b317132f288d2217086a0de1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "ff6ea90a4338e4ee979fc7afa57197b839aff587b317132f288d2217086a0de1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我的文字虽不算很好，可是还看得过去。",
      "output_sha256": "73bf35c31d7b3757501cbd1301ce0adf07a6dee52a4e7beeb1644671fd1d26ef",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "73bf35c31d7b3757501cbd1301ce0adf07a6dee52a4e7beeb1644671fd1d26ef",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "足见文学作品并不专仗着文字来支持，它还需要许多东西呢。",
      "output_sha256": "69e40fa936071f03419a7f1f41ea163317f6d14a25fa36517a152f4bfe895cbb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "69e40fa936071f03419a7f1f41ea163317f6d14a25fa36517a152f4bfe895cbb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "首先是，我的生活不够。",
      "output_sha256": "a0c88dc844405a28015397abd698444168b8644decc6875a4e6b3615fb8f144a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "a0c88dc844405a28015397abd698444168b8644decc6875a4e6b3615fb8f144a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不错，我已快六十岁了，作过三十多年的事，跑过国内国外不少地方，读过不少的书，怎么还说生活不够呢？",
      "output_sha256": "dc1605bf017ae87961c271a6085ccb9619cd554c8558d858ba60d4e852ad75a2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "dc1605bf017ae87961c271a6085ccb9619cd554c8558d858ba60d4e852ad75a2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "是的，的确是不够。",
      "output_sha256": "a3fb2a1fa95aff4f0856f17e3861ff7d5b35d63ea069a7007b032ec24a8af670",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "a3fb2a1fa95aff4f0856f17e3861ff7d5b35d63ea069a7007b032ec24a8af670",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我对新社会的生活，工农兵的生活，都体验得不够，很不够。",
      "output_sha256": "9c63fd9b5a007cdde03bbd3b4cf6644873fd92d48f5bc9a4fd44b556709ad729",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "9c63fd9b5a007cdde03bbd3b4cf6644873fd92d48f5bc9a4fd44b556709ad729",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "因此，我的作品内容不够丰富，情感也不够深厚。",
      "output_sha256": "a8540264e900818118dca21d88f71c5c44c3a6afff30e3959e4e16ab8f0cf7e4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": 0.53725,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bb9a921b47c277e90c422232f5e033c8092e9a6573f5d76df8fb532b044051fb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a8540264e900818118dca21d88f71c5c44c3a6afff30e3959e4e16ab8f0cf7e4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我有颗年轻的心，我不怕辛苦，可是我写不出好作品。",
      "output_sha256": "3e53b627b810620e63567a51b8ca404c51e946d2516d5985fec5e8be25cfda1e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "3e53b627b810620e63567a51b8ca404c51e946d2516d5985fec5e8be25cfda1e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "青年们，别叫我的困难吓住你们，失去勇气。",
      "output_sha256": "8e0b3045e46272a9952b354dbf82512638fd83e91f95d59c53c3d0e0ee626ab8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "8e0b3045e46272a9952b354dbf82512638fd83e91f95d59c53c3d0e0ee626ab8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "你们应当勇往直前，勇于面对困难。",
      "output_sha256": "97fc2fcf720e5eb2fdef5757cd3a0b59a656fca42e60196a42401bb48153d589",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.596881,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "86f87e9b0dcc6c328daa7a7e9867779938d449772fe9773ce39eabfd0dde8f71"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_ai_sha256": "97fc2fcf720e5eb2fdef5757cd3a0b59a656fca42e60196a42401bb48153d589",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "但是，也千万别以为写作是容易的事。",
      "output_sha256": "4e8fbb40df074248500d73cfa9dcec4a583a7eb6392fd96546609c92f4be1807",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "4e8fbb40df074248500d73cfa9dcec4a583a7eb6392fd96546609c92f4be1807",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "受到别人的批评，或稿子被退回来，不必灰心；我到今天还时常受到严格的批评，也常把写成的稿子扔在纸筐里。",
      "output_sha256": "19a3498f533017dac5ba7d5184b4dba8db2d14da43c0568501d13cef774823f0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "19a3498f533017dac5ba7d5184b4dba8db2d14da43c0568501d13cef774823f0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "要生活，要生活！",
      "output_sha256": "4f78f3b8399a84f7a37f94a163cbf50d3837979ce1c3a868729e825914dcc1c1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "4f78f3b8399a84f7a37f94a163cbf50d3837979ce1c3a868729e825914dcc1c1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "关上门等灵感，它永远不会来。",
      "output_sha256": "e4a6d0ee52c0f5964e44aa545781868b7b0dabe7de797b2668e6adcabf48c046",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "e4a6d0ee52c0f5964e44aa545781868b7b0dabe7de797b2668e6adcabf48c046",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "想成为作家，又害怕艰难，成功就会遥遥无期。",
      "output_sha256": "66631db3c51ff9f3cc7da0e30cd0279b04077692bb15953233e4974f52d9d760",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": 0.441991,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        53
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cf016cfb4fe165330b601e2f82b0947b75efae33a7a300468cd2c0566c29b1f5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_ai_sha256": "66631db3c51ff9f3cc7da0e30cd0279b04077692bb15953233e4974f52d9d760",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "写作是最艰苦严肃的工作。",
      "output_sha256": "fa6be9838dc8339bc9670d594782b7f37008202af3e0a54da4f70e0b2d5295ff",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "fa6be9838dc8339bc9670d594782b7f37008202af3e0a54da4f70e0b2d5295ff",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "有了生活经历，但如果不懂得马克思列宁主义，那也不够用。",
      "output_sha256": "54655a380651e7b6c7defbf43c938eca64bde32728a781a09ad5cc6f2610d25f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.473788,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        55
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "287743da3f9a71435470b57e9ca3b7ee1cbef303676c8dd91b3e5bdfd52aae45"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_ai_sha256": "54655a380651e7b6c7defbf43c938eca64bde32728a781a09ad5cc6f2610d25f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我曾经就吃过这个亏。",
      "output_sha256": "fb1cae576032838acf2866e5fa02582d58ffe5027003450b108d7deb49288914",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": 0.511806,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        56
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d3e169ffbc6f4c46ce4bf70f2e47e2c820ad795dfa891b9b76a42cd7c2ac29f8"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fb1cae576032838acf2866e5fa02582d58ffe5027003450b108d7deb49288914",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我只在解放后，才跟着大家学习一点，所以我对马列主义的一知半解，不能帮助我在作品中尽到传播先进思想的责任。",
      "output_sha256": "97e947e457c709957413c78a2916bd2d67841889b908220982b98ca83e63a155",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "97e947e457c709957413c78a2916bd2d67841889b908220982b98ca83e63a155",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我的作品缺乏思想性。",
      "output_sha256": "26ec47e1b6051d45b6ad0bc419bfa86ebfee3df9f4eb880faf9c1e9679ac2ccd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "26ec47e1b6051d45b6ad0bc419bfa86ebfee3df9f4eb880faf9c1e9679ac2ccd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这又须艰苦地去学习。",
      "output_sha256": "6e40eecf7f613f60390aff4d7f6163f7df0b77f41a3dd9ffba622d9e8c44bd08",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "6e40eecf7f613f60390aff4d7f6163f7df0b77f41a3dd9ffba622d9e8c44bd08",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "什么时候把丰富的生活与正确的思想结合起来，咱们才能写出既有生活又有思想的作品。",
      "output_sha256": "d650219d50eca4a8afc0464c2086e96417072df1871d7e833e538ce741d26784",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 60,
      "source_human_sha256": "d650219d50eca4a8afc0464c2086e96417072df1871d7e833e538ce741d26784",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "而且，我们正处于建设社会主义的时代，因此生活必然与革命斗争息息相关。",
      "output_sha256": "8edc865666bcb7f3977e9060f0a027ba0f77936b0f647d15814eea64fb749048",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": 0.530053,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        61
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b9faa15b512c8a8a00267b7fc130ceae20927418cc3b3862c31287734fa36fea"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8edc865666bcb7f3977e9060f0a027ba0f77936b0f647d15814eea64fb749048",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我也缺乏这种实际经验与锻炼。",
      "output_sha256": "3af55cb1baec9d074fa5fbabfc6641ba5814b66353847102e4c9de4f827f5ba1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 62,
      "source_human_sha256": "3af55cb1baec9d074fa5fbabfc6641ba5814b66353847102e4c9de4f827f5ba1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我的写作资料多数是听来的。",
      "output_sha256": "fc4cedbe5099075aaf47f5f7af4a4000118fa5ad63a5f908a86c6522d6938c80",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 63,
      "source_human_sha256": "fc4cedbe5099075aaf47f5f7af4a4000118fa5ad63a5f908a86c6522d6938c80",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "听别人唱歌和自己唱歌，显然是两个不同的体验。",
      "output_sha256": "753f2bd0d0f09e2a0cc496a9b59981e9a7a1d5dd59b31e40d48ba12a8eb88fe2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": 0.646364,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        64
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8fcae41c2e607680cfe4cc1ca9ed99c1539f3165f51edfd2ce146f31facb998d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_ai_sha256": "753f2bd0d0f09e2a0cc496a9b59981e9a7a1d5dd59b31e40d48ba12a8eb88fe2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 63,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "若要描写歌唱的乐趣或困难，最好还是亲自去体验一下。",
